rep("<strong>Target return-on-investment pricing</strong> involves setting a price", '<p><strong>Target return-on-investment pricing</strong> sets a price to achieve an annual target return on investment (ROI). Firms frame profit this way because they choose among competing projects and want their money where the return is best.</p>')
